BT 1 0 0 1 0 62.4 Tm 3.100521 Tw /F2+0 12 Tf 18.6 TL (Attendance is the record of the lectures which a student has attended. In every college a) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.102214 Tw (minimum attendance, such as 75%, is required to be eligible for the examination. In many classes) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.144301 Tw (the teacher still marks the attendance on paper and calculates the percentage by hand at the end of) Tj T* 0 Tw (the month or the semester. This takes time and the calculation may also go wrong.) Tj T* ET
