BT 1 0 0 1 0 99.6 Tm 3.361328 Tw 18.6 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 12 Tf 18.6 TL (In this project a ) Tj /F3+0 12 Tf 18.6 TL (Student Attendance Tracker) Tj /F2+0 12 Tf 18.6 TL ( is made in Python for the course Python) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.494318 Tw (Programming Language \(N-PCCCM304P\). The teacher enters the students and the number of) Tj T* 0 Tw .721615 Tw (lectures, marks every student Present \(P\) or Absent \(A\) for every lecture, and the program then) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.065655 Tw (shows a complete attendance report. The report has the total lectures, lectures present, lectures) Tj T* 0 Tw .464286 Tw (absent, the attendance percentage and the status of every student. A student whose attendance is) Tj T* 0 Tw (below 75% is shown as DEFAULTER and the others are shown as REGULAR.) Tj T* ET
