BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.8 Tm .782151 Tw 18.6 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 12 Tf 18.6 TL (The complete program is given below \(file name: attendance_tracker.py\). It is run normally for) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.096224 Tw (entering the attendance by hand and with the option ) Tj /F6+0 10 Tf 18.6 TL (--demo) Tj /F2+0 12 Tf 18.6 TL ( for the automatic demo with 8) Tj T* 0 Tw (students and 20 lectures.) Tj T* ET
